# Supply-chain scan exceptions live here.
#
# Permanent suppressions are forbidden. Every active entry must be preceded by
# exactly one metadata line in this form:
#   # owner=@github-handle; tracking=#123; reason=Why this risk is temporarily accepted
#   FINDING-ID exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# tools/supply_chain.py enforces expiry, ownership, tracking, and a maximum
# exception lifetime of 90 days. There are intentionally no exceptions today.
